cd D:\OPS
docker compose up -d

Haan. Tumhara project Docker Compose se run hota hai.

Server start karne ke liye:

PowerShell:

cd D:\OPS
docker compose up -d

Phir check:

docker compose ps

Tumhe ye chahiye:

opspilot-n8n        Up
opspilot-postgres   Up (healthy)
n8n open karo:
http://localhost:5678
Server stop karna ho:
docker compose down
Logs dekhne hon:
docker compose logs n8n --tail=50

Ab docker compose up -d chalao → docker compose ps check karo → phir n8n open ka